      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "NIGHTLY • 0.6 BASELINE • Deferred Upscale - DLSS5 + LMS Guide - EXPERIMENTAL\n\n1. Install Ref2VA H3, its Qwen encoder/video VAE, Ref2V Turbo 4step v0.1, LMS v1.0 r64, and DLSS5.\n2. Select a saved source lineage in Checkpoint Manager and a NEW upscale profile.\n3. First test ONE short scene (start_clip=1/end_clip=1); full-scene guide sampling is memory-heavy.\n4. Confirm the actual upscale canvas is /32; follow the sampler/decode/save columns.\n5. Read the companion guide before changing the recipe or expanding the range.\n\nWorkflow-specific setup and detailed wiring notes:\nexample_workflows/guides/Deferred Upscale - DLSS5 + LMS Guide - EXPERIMENTAL - MiniMax H3 0.6.md"
      ]
    }
